def author(c,s,m,a):
 c('b221','潮汐交換、基礎保護與巨型閘門荷載的共同約束~Coupled constraints on tidal exchange, foundation protection and large gate loads',['rws-east','rws-east-work','rws-maeslant'],r'''
開口流速與收縮~Opening velocity and contraction||保留潮汐交換需要流通面積，但墩柱壓縮通道使局部速度上升。斷面平均速度不是閘緣噴流速度，動壓與紊流剪應力又隨速度平方變化。比較同一流量的不同開口，才能看見縮窄後的海床代價。~Preserving tidal exchange requires flow area, while piers contract the channels and accelerate local currents. Section-mean velocity differs from the gate-edge jet. Dynamic pressure and turbulent stresses depend on velocity squared, so comparing openings at fixed discharge reveals the seabed consequences of contraction.||假設總流量6000 m³/s、有效開口3000 m²，平均流速Q/A=2 m/s；局部面積減20%則為2.5 m/s。只比較準穩定斷面，不模擬迴流。~Assume discharge 6000 m³/s and effective area 3000 m²: Q/A=2 m/s. Reducing area by twenty percent gives 2.5 m/s. This compares quasi-steady sections and excludes recirculation.||把聲學流速剖面按同一潮相積分，核對斷面流量與上下游水位差；另取閘緣測線，避免以河道中央的單點值代表整個收縮流場。~Integrate acoustic velocity profiles at matched tidal phases and compare section discharge with the water-level difference. Add gate-edge transects instead of treating a central point as the entire contracted flow field.||局部高速帶若穿過未保護接縫，平均流速正常仍可能淘空床層。潮向翻轉會把危險區換邊，因此只有單向測線無法確認完整保護範圍。~A narrow fast jet crossing an unprotected joint may erode the bed despite an acceptable average velocity. Tidal reversal moves the vulnerable side, so one-direction transects cannot establish the full protection footprint.||開口平均流速相同並不代表閘緣沖刷相同。~Equal opening-average velocity does not imply equal edge scour.
潮稜體與生態交換~Tidal prism and ecological exchange||潮稜體衡量一個漲潮期間進出的水量，不能直接當成全部水體換新。港灣分支與渦流會保留舊水，同時影響鹽度與棲地。把幾何儲水量和示蹤交換效率分開，可避免以流量總和誤判生態效果。~The tidal prism measures water exchanged during a flood tide, but does not mean every parcel is renewed. Branches and recirculation retain older water and influence salinity and habitats. Separating geometric storage from tracer exchange prevents cumulative flow from being mistaken for ecological renewal.||假設海灣有效面積80 km²、潮差2 m，棱體AΔh=160 million m³；若完全混合且交換率0.3，等效新水為48 million m³，不含河流。~Assume effective bay area 80 km² and tidal range 2 m: AΔh=160 million m³. With complete mixing and exchange efficiency 0.3, effective new water is 48 million m³, excluding rivers.||對齊潮位基準、濕潤面積曲線與鹽度剖面；比較漲落潮的示蹤訊號是否返回，並以多個分支測站判斷完全混合假設在哪些區域失效。~Align tidal datum, wetted-area curves and salinity profiles. Compare tracer returns between flood and ebb, using stations in several branches to identify where the complete-mixing assumption fails.||只用固定面積乘潮差可能漏掉潮灘乾濕變化；把同一團回流海水重複計為新水，也會低估污染物停留時間，掩蓋局部缺氧風險。~A fixed area times tidal range misses wetting and drying of tidal flats. Counting recirculated seawater repeatedly as new inflow underestimates contaminant residence and can conceal localized oxygen depletion.||潮汐交換體積大並不保證每個灣角換水快。~A large tidal prism does not guarantee rapid renewal everywhere.
雙側水壓合力~Differential hydrostatic gate force||閘門承受兩側壓力之差，兩邊都濕潤時不能只畫上游三角形。合力大小與作用點分別決定傳遞到支承的剪力及彎矩；潮位反轉時也必須檢查相反方向的接觸與止水。~A gate carries the difference between pressures on its two sides, so a single upstream triangle is insufficient when both sides are wet. Resultant magnitude and elevation determine support shear and moment. Reversing the tide also reverses contact and seal demands.||取淡水密度ρ=1000 kg/m³、g=9.81 m/s²。假設直立矩形板寬10 m，兩側水深6及4 m，同密度淡水且靜止；F=ρgb(h1²−h2²)/2=981 kN，不含波浪或海水密度差。~Use freshwater density ρ=1000 kg/m³ and g=9.81 m/s². Assume a vertical rectangular plate ten metres wide, still fresh water depths 6 and 4 m: F=ρgb(h1²−h2²)/2=981 kN, excluding waves and seawater density differences.||分別繪出兩側壓力圖後相減，再對底部積分求彎矩；將水位計的共同基準與閘門幾何測量交叉核對，不能用壓差單值猜合力作用點。~Plot both pressure diagrams, subtract them and integrate moments about the base. Cross-check the gauges common datum against surveyed gate geometry rather than inferring the resultant elevation from one pressure difference.||測站基準差會造成虛假淨水頭，導致支承反力估計偏移。若忽略波浪瞬時吸力或門體變形，靜水合力相符仍不能證明焊縫與導輪安全。~A gauge datum mismatch creates false net head and shifts inferred reactions. Ignoring transient wave suction or gate deformation means agreement with hydrostatic force cannot demonstrate weld or guide-wheel adequacy.||兩側有水時不可把上游水壓當成淨荷載。~Upstream pressure alone is not the net load when both sides are wet.
反濾層顆粒保持~Filter particle retention||護床石下方的細土不能被水流穿過大孔隙帶走，反濾層須同時保持基土並讓水排出。單一粒徑比例只是初步篩選；廣級配、分散性與流向反轉需要材料試驗，不能靠增厚大石代替細部相容。~Fine foundation soil must not migrate through voids beneath armor. Filters must retain the base soil while allowing drainage. A grain-size ratio is only screening evidence; broad grading, dispersivity and flow reversal require material testing rather than simply placing thicker large rock.||假設基土d85=0.5 mm、反濾料D15=1.8 mm，保持比D15/d85=3.6；只作粒徑比較，不宣稱適用所有土類的驗收門檻。~Assume base-soil d85=0.5 mm and filter D15=1.8 mm. Their retention ratio is 3.6, a grading comparison rather than an acceptance limit applicable to every soil.||從鋪設後取樣重建粒徑曲線，檢查運輸離析與細料流失；用方向可反轉的滲流試驗比較出水濁度、沉降與水頭損失，保存原土分類。~Reconstruct grading from placed samples and check segregation and fines loss. Use reversible-flow seepage tests to compare effluent turbidity, settlement and head loss while retaining the base-soil classification.||粗料看似排水良好卻可能放走細土，過細反濾層則會堵塞並增加上浮水壓。若只檢查料場樣品，現場離析形成的薄弱帶可能完全漏判。~Coarse material may drain freely while losing soil; an overly fine filter can clog and raise uplift. Stockpile-only testing can entirely miss weak bands produced by segregation during placement.||反濾層越粗或越厚並不必然越安全。~A coarser or thicker filter is not automatically safer.
護床起動與尺度~Armor mobility and scale||床粒起動受流體剪應力與顆粒有效重量競爭控制。Shields參數把尺寸和密度納入同一比值，但局部亂流、坡度及石塊咬合會改變實際起動。它適合比較候選護床，不直接決定完整海床保護設計。~Particle motion reflects competition between fluid shear and submerged particle weight. The Shields parameter includes size and density, but local turbulence, slope and interlocking alter actual initiation. It compares candidate protection materials without determining a complete seabed protection design.||取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設床剪應力30 Pa、石密度2650、水密度1000 kg/m³、粒徑0.1 m；θ=30/((2650−1000)9.81×0.1)=0.01853，非通用臨界值。~Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume shear stress 30 Pa, rock and water densities 2650 and 1000 kg/m³, diameter 0.1 m: θ=30/((2650−1000)9.81×0.1)=0.01853. This is not a universal critical value.||比較不同潮相的近床紊流與重複測深，將石粒移位標記到坡面、邊界和接縫；用試驗確認起動分散程度，而非只查一個平均粒徑。~Compare near-bed turbulence and repeat bathymetry across tidal phases. Map displaced stones to slopes, edges and joints, and use tests to characterize variability in initiation rather than checking only mean diameter.||邊緣保護長度不足會產生淘刷坑，再向墩底倒退侵蝕。即使石塊本身未被搬走，下面的反濾料被抽出仍可能使護床整片下沉。~Insufficient edge protection creates a scour hole that can migrate back toward the pier. Even immobile armor can subside as a sheet when underlying filter material is removed through its voids.||石塊未移動不代表其下方基土沒有流失。~Stationary armor does not prove that underlying soil is retained.
墩底接觸偏心~Eccentric pier bearing||巨型墩底將門體水平荷載轉成基礎壓力分布，偏心越大越可能出現局部脫離。線性接觸模型只有在全底面受壓時適用；海床不平、局部沖刷與土體壓縮會使剛體假設改變。~A large pier converts gate horizontal loading into foundation pressure. Increasing eccentricity can cause partial separation. Linear contact stress applies only with full compression; uneven seabed, local scour and compressible ground can invalidate the assumed rigid-base behavior.||假設每延米底寬12 m、豎力2400 kN/m、偏心1 m，全壓線性模型q=V/B(1±6e/B)，得到300及100 kPa；未考慮上浮。~Assume base width 12 m, vertical force 2400 kN/m and eccentricity 1 m. Full-contact linear q=V/B(1±6e/B) gives 300 and 100 kPa, before uplift is considered.||把傾斜、沉降與底部孔壓的時間序列同步，先扣除潮汐彈性反應，再查反覆荷載後是否留下殘餘位移；重算淨豎力和接觸面積。~Synchronize tilt, settlement and foundation pore-pressure histories. Separate reversible tidal response from residual displacement after loading, then recalculate net vertical force and actual contact area.||把總重量直接當有效正向力會高估抗滑與接觸壓力。若線性式算出拉應力仍保留全接觸面積，後續承載力分析會系統性低估局部集中。~Treating gross weight as effective normal force overestimates sliding resistance and contact loading. Keeping a full contact area after the linear solution predicts tension systematically understates local stress concentration.||基底出現計算拉力時，全接觸公式已需重建。~A predicted tensile base stress requires reconsidering full contact.
潮位滯後與上浮~Tidal lag and uplift||潮水變化傳入地基孔隙需要時間，因此外部低潮不保證墩底孔壓也低。排水路徑與滲透率決定壓力滯後，必須用同時刻的外水位與基底壓力計算有效重量。靜態最高水位包絡未必捕捉最差組合。~Tidal changes take time to propagate through foundation pores, so low external water does not ensure low pressure beneath a pier. Drainage paths and permeability control lag. Effective weight requires simultaneous external and basal pressures, not unrelated maximum-level envelopes.||假設墩底面積200 m²、平均超額孔壓25 kPa，附加上浮U=ΔuA=5000 kN；均勻孔壓為簡化，不含沿底面相位差。~Assume base area 200 m² and mean excess pore pressure 25 kPa. Additional uplift U=ΔuA=5000 kN. Uniform pressure is assumed, excluding phase differences across the base.||以不同深度孔壓計追蹤漲退潮的相位與幅度，並確認儀器氣泡、零點漂移和資料延遲；將孔壓積分的上浮結果與傾斜事件時間對照。~Track phase and amplitude using piezometers at several depths, checking trapped air, zero drift and logging delay. Compare integrated uplift with the timing of observed pier tilting.||排水堵塞可能先表現為退潮後孔壓消散變慢，而不是最大讀數突然增高。只看每日峰值會錯過有效重量最低的短暫階段，掩蓋滑動敏感期。~Drainage blockage may first appear as slower dissipation after ebb rather than a higher peak reading. Daily maxima alone miss brief minimum-effective-weight periods and conceal increased sliding sensitivity.||低潮期間基底孔壓不一定立即降到最低。~Foundation pore pressure need not reach its minimum at low tide.
弗勞德縮尺相似~Froude model similarity||重力主導自由水面的試驗需保持弗勞德數，速度和時間按長度平方根縮放。黏性與表面張力通常不能同時滿足相似，所以模型中的薄水層與小顆粒運動可能失真，量測結果必須附尺度限制。~Gravity-dominated free-surface tests preserve Froude number, scaling velocity and time with the square root of length. Viscosity and surface tension generally cannot also be matched, so thin flows and small particle motions may distort and require explicit scale qualifications.||假設原型與模型長度比25:1，模型流速0.4 m/s；原型速度為0.4√25=2 m/s，模型60 s對應原型300 s；僅適用重力相似。~Assume prototype-to-model length ratio 25:1 and model velocity 0.4 m/s. Prototype velocity is 0.4√25=2 m/s; model 60 s represents 300 s, under gravity similarity only.||先列出長度、時間、速度與流量各自縮尺，再用無因次水位和速度曲線比較多個模型尺寸；若曲線不能重合，查雷諾數與表面張力效應。~List separate length, time, velocity and discharge scales, then compare dimensionless level and velocity curves across model sizes. Failure to collapse the curves prompts checks of Reynolds-number and surface-tension effects.||把模型砂直接按幾何比例替換，可能改變黏聚性與起動機制。即使水面曲線相似，沖刷深度仍可能受到顆粒尺度效應支配，不能只靠影片判斷。~Geometrically scaling sand can change cohesion and the initiation mechanism. Even similar water-surface curves may accompany scale-dependent scour depths, so visual similarity alone is not adequate validation.||水面相似並不保證顆粒運動也符合縮尺。~Similar water surfaces do not guarantee scaled sediment behavior.
預報偏差與時間裕度~Forecast bias and time margin||防潮決策必須在危險水位抵達前完成資訊、判斷與機械動作。預報水位誤差和到達時間誤差是不同量，海象快速惡化時不能互相替代。課堂只分析時間預算，不重建任何設施的實際關閘規則。~A protective decision must accommodate information, assessment and mechanical response before hazardous water arrives. Water-level error differs from arrival-time error and cannot substitute for it during rapid change. The classroom model examines a time budget without reproducing operational closure rules.||假設預警提前150 min、判讀20 min、準備15 min、動作75 min，剩餘裕度40 min；各值皆假設，未含相關延遲與預報不確定度。~Assume warning lead 150 min, assessment 20 min, preparation 15 min and movement 75 min. Remaining margin is 40 min; all are assumed and exclude correlated delays and forecast uncertainty.||在歷次演練資料標註預報發行、接收、確認與完成時間，以同一時鐘計算分布；另列漏報與假警報，不能只報平均完成時間來評價決策品質。~Timestamp forecast issue, receipt, confirmation and completion in exercise records using one clock. Evaluate missed events and false alarms separately instead of judging decisions solely by average completion time.||通訊中斷、供電擾動與人員確認可能同受一場風暴影響，直接相加獨立平均值會高估裕度。時間戳不一致也可能把資料延遲誤認為機械遲緩。~Communications, power and confirmation can be impaired by the same storm, making independent average delays optimistic. Inconsistent timestamps can also make data latency appear to be slow machinery.||平均完成時間不能代表風暴中的最差裕度。~Average completion time does not represent the worst storm margin.
腐蝕餘厚與疲勞~Corrosion allowance and fatigue||鹽水環境的板件減薄降低截面能力，但焊趾疲勞又取決於局部應力範圍與循環數。均勻腐蝕速率只做餘厚預測，不能替代點蝕量測或裂紋檢查；維護判讀要把材料損失和疲勞機制分列。~Saline exposure reduces plate section, while weld fatigue depends on local stress range and cycle count. Uniform corrosion rate predicts remaining thickness but cannot replace pitting surveys or crack inspection. Maintenance interpretation must separate material loss from cyclic damage.||假設初厚20 mm、均勻腐蝕0.08 mm/year、經過15 years，餘厚18.8 mm；若截面寬不變，面積損失6%，不據此推定疲勞壽命。~Assume initial thickness 20 mm and uniform corrosion 0.08 mm/year over 15 years. Remaining thickness is 18.8 mm and area loss is six percent at constant width; fatigue life is not inferred.||固定網格重複超音波測厚，特別覆蓋水線、焊縫與積水角；以塗層狀況和裂紋檢測對照厚度趨勢，保留儀器校正及量測位置重現性。~Repeat ultrasonic thickness measurements on a fixed grid covering waterlines, welds and trapped-water corners. Compare coating condition and crack inspection with thickness trends, preserving calibration and location repeatability.||以平均厚度遮蔽單個深坑會高估局部承載能力；反過來把表面粗糙造成的回波誤差當真減薄也會誤導維護。焊趾裂紋可在餘厚足夠時擴展。~Average thickness can conceal a deep local pit and overstate resistance, while roughness-related echo error can imitate thinning. Weld-toe cracks may continue growing even where remaining gross thickness appears adequate.||餘厚足夠不等於焊縫疲勞損傷不存在。~Adequate remaining thickness does not exclude weld fatigue damage.
''')
 for i,ex,out,un in [(1,'6000/(3000*.8)',2.5,'m/s'),(2,'80e6*2*.3',48e6,'m3'),(3,'1000*9.81*10*(6**2-4**2)/2/1000',981,'kN'),(4,'1.8/.5',3.6,'ratio'),(5,'30/((2650-1000)*9.81*.1)',.0185343,'dimensionless'),(6,'2400/12*(1+6/12)',300,'kPa'),(7,'200*25',5000,'kN'),(8,'60*math.sqrt(25)',300,'s'),(9,'150-20-15-75',40,'min'),(10,'20-.08*15',18.8,'mm')]:a('b221',i,ex,out,un)
 c('b222','浮運沉降、球鉸傳力與風暴期間可靠度的共同分析~Joint analysis of flotation, sinking, spherical-joint loading and storm reliability',['rws-maeslant','hollandia-maeslant','rws-east'],r'''
浮運吃水與壓載~Floating draft and ballast||中空閘門靠排水體積承受自重，注水後有效浮力減少。水線面積決定增加重量所造成的吃水變化，不能用門高直接換算沉降。~A hollow gate floats by displacement; ballast changes its net buoyancy. Waterplane area controls the draft change caused by added mass, rather than the overall gate height.||假設水線面積1200 m²、加入淡水質量600 t，外水密度1025 kg/m³；ΔT=m/(ρA)=0.4878 m，限小吃水與固定水線面積。~Assume waterplane area 1200 m², added mass 600 t and external density 1025 kg/m³. ΔT=m/(ρA)=0.4878 m, for small changes and constant waterplane area.||同步比較左右吃水、艙內水量與門體傾角，檢查壓載質量是否與排水增量一致；把鹽度引起的外水密度變化另外列出。~Compare port and starboard drafts, ballast volume and tilt synchronously. Check added mass against displaced volume and record salinity-related external density changes separately.||艙內自由液面會削弱穩定性，即使總浮力平衡也可能出現傾斜。若一側進水較快，剛體平均吃水模型便漏掉扭轉與局部碰撞的危險。~Internal free surfaces reduce stability even when total buoyancy balances weight. Unequal filling creates tilt, so a mean-draft model misses twisting and local collision hazards during the transition.||浮力等於重量並不證明漂浮姿態穩定。~Balanced weight and buoyancy do not prove stable attitude.
球鉸支臂力矩~Spherical-joint arm moment||球接頭容許多方向轉動，卻仍需把巨大門體荷載傳入陸側基礎。支臂幾何控制力矩和軸力分配，轉動自由不代表沒有反力。~A spherical joint permits rotation in several directions while transmitting gate loads into shore foundations. Arm geometry controls moment and axial-force distribution; rotational freedom does not eliminate reaction forces.||假設水平合力8 MN、對基礎有效力臂60 m，外力矩M=Fr=480 MN·m；這是整體平衡量，非球鉸直接承受的純彎矩。~Assume horizontal resultant 8 MN and effective foundation lever arm 60 m. External moment M=Fr=480 MN·m is a global equilibrium quantity, not a pure moment carried directly by the ball joint.||繪出門體、支臂和球鉸分別的自由體圖，再用應變與位移方向核對內力路徑；確認力臂量的是垂直距離而非桁架長度。~Draw separate free-body diagrams for gate, arm and joint. Check load paths with strain and displacement directions, ensuring lever arm means perpendicular distance rather than truss length.||將球鉸錯當固定端會扭曲桁架內力，忽略支承摩擦又會低估局部拘束。若基礎轉動未列入，量測變形可能被錯誤解讀為鋼材損傷。~Treating the ball joint as fixed distorts truss forces, while omitting friction understates local restraint. Excluding foundation rotation can make measured movement appear to be steel damage.||可轉動的球鉸仍會傳遞很大的合力。~A rotating spherical joint can still transmit very large forces.
支臂壓桿穩定~Arm compression-member stability||細長支臂桿件可能先失穩再達材料降伏，端部拘束決定有效長度。理想歐拉式只說明幾何敏感性，實際彎曲與殘餘應力需另外處理。~A slender arm member can buckle before yielding, and end restraint sets effective length. Euler theory illustrates geometric sensitivity but leaves initial curvature and residual stresses to separate assessment.||假設E=200 GPa、I=0.08 m⁴、鉸支長40 m，Pcr=π²EI/L²=98.696 MN；理想直桿彈性屈曲，未含缺陷或設計折減。~Assume E=200 GPa, I=0.08 m⁴ and pinned length 40 m. Pcr=π²EI/L²=98.696 MN, for an ideal straight elastic member without imperfections or design reductions.||以測量所得桿件初彎曲建立幾何模型，核對節點轉動和側向支撐位置；比較不同有效長度的敏感性，不直接把理論臨界力當容許荷載。~Model measured initial curvature, joint rotation and lateral bracing locations. Compare sensitivity to effective length instead of treating the theoretical critical force as an allowable load.||節點腐蝕或鬆動會改變端部拘束，讓先前的有效長度假設失效。若只檢查材料強度，便可能漏掉受壓桿件突然出現的側向失穩。~Joint corrosion or looseness changes end restraint and invalidates an earlier effective length. Checking material strength alone can miss sudden lateral instability in an otherwise apparently adequate compression member.||材料未降伏不代表細長受壓桿件不會屈曲。~A slender compression member can buckle before its material yields.
曲面門水壓分解~Resolving pressure on curved gates||曲面水壓應按法向分布積分，水平分量可由垂直投影求得，垂直分量則與上覆假想水體有關。曲面面積不能直接乘最大壓力。~Pressure acts normal to a curved surface. Its horizontal component follows the vertical projection, while its vertical component relates to an imaginary overlying water volume; surface area times maximum pressure is inappropriate.||取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設垂直投影寬20 m、水深5 m、單側靜水密度1025 kg/m³；水平分量ρgbh²/2=2.514 MN，未求曲面垂直分量。~Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume vertical projection width 20 m, one-sided depth 5 m and water density 1025 kg/m³. Horizontal force ρgbh²/2=2.514 MN; the curved-surface vertical component remains separate.||分別畫水平與垂直投影，對照多點壓力計積分與結構反力；若潮水淹過門頂或兩側皆有水，須更新濕潤邊界再計算。~Draw separate horizontal and vertical projections, comparing integrated pressure measurements with reactions. Revise wetted boundaries whenever water overtops the gate or occupies both sides.||把水壓視為全水平會漏掉浮沉方向荷載，影響壓載與接觸判斷。波浪使壓力隨時間和位置改變，靜水分量不能代表瞬間最大合力。~Treating all pressure as horizontal misses vertical loading that affects ballast and contact. Waves vary pressure in time and space, so the hydrostatic component cannot represent the maximum transient resultant.||曲面水壓合力一般不只包含水平分量。~A curved gate generally carries more than horizontal hydrostatic force.
自由液面穩定修正~Free-surface stability correction||未滿的壓載艙在傾斜時移動液體重心，降低初始復原能力。相同水量分裝在窄艙或集中於寬艙，穩定效果可以不同。~Partially filled ballast tanks move the liquid center of gravity during heel and reduce initial stability. Equal water volumes distributed among narrow tanks or one wide tank can have different effects.||假設艙液密度1000 kg/m³、自由液面慣性矩8000 m⁴、總排水質量20 million kg，虛擬重心升高ρI/m=0.4 m，限小傾角。~Assume tank-liquid density 1000 kg/m³, free-surface second moment 8000 m⁴ and displacement mass 20 million kg. Virtual center-of-gravity rise ρI/m=0.4 m, for small heel.||以艙形與液位算自由液面慣性矩，核對隔板是否真正限制橫向流動；將傾角資料對應每個充水階段，而非只看最初和最終狀態。~Calculate free-surface moments from tank shape and level, checking whether baffles actually restrict transverse flow. Relate heel measurements to each filling stage rather than only initial and final conditions.||部分充水的過渡階段可能比空艙或滿艙更不利。若把隔板當成密閉分艙而實際有大開孔，計算會低估液體轉移和動態晃蕩。~An intermediate filling stage may be less stable than empty or full tanks. Treating perforated baffles as sealed subdivisions understates liquid transfer and dynamic sloshing across the available free surface.||壓載艙半滿時不一定比全滿時更穩定。~A half-full ballast tank need not be more stable than a full one.
沉放前底隙流量~Under-gate flow before seating||閘門接近底床時，剩餘狹縫承受水位差並形成高速流。縮小間隙可能降低總流量卻提高局部梯度，對沉積物與門體振動產生不同作用。~As a gate approaches the sill, the remaining slot carries the head difference and forms a jet. A smaller gap may reduce discharge while increasing local gradients, affecting sediment and vibration differently.||取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設狹縫寬30 m、高0.2 m、壓差水頭1 m、Cd=0.65；Q=CdA√(2gΔh)=17.27 m³/s，僅為穩定孔口近似。~Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume slot width 30 m, height 0.2 m, head difference 1 m and Cd=0.65. Q=CdA√(2gΔh)=17.27 m³/s, a steady-orifice approximation only.||對照底隙幾何、上下游水位與局部聲學流速，檢查孔口係數是否隨門位改變；把渦動頻率與門體振動頻譜比較而非只看流量。~Compare gap geometry, head and local acoustic velocities, checking how the discharge coefficient varies with position. Compare vortex frequencies with gate vibration spectra rather than examining flow rate alone.||底床殘留砂石會使間隙不均，形成集中噴流與不對稱支承。若把單一水位差當作整條狹縫的條件，可能漏判局部氣蝕或振動區域。~Debris creates uneven gaps, concentrated jets and asymmetric contact. Assigning one head difference uniformly along the slot may miss localized cavitation or vibration zones near changing sill geometry.||總漏流變小不代表所有局部流速都變小。~Lower total leakage does not mean every local velocity decreases.
止水縫漏流診斷~Seal leakage diagnosis||止水縫的漏流同時受縫寬、壓差和變形控制，漏水量增大不一定是橡膠老化。以同水頭比較流量，可先排除水位改變造成的表面趨勢。~Seal leakage depends on gap, head and deformation, so increased flow does not necessarily indicate rubber ageing. Comparing at equal head first removes water-level changes that can imitate deterioration.||取重力加速度g=9.81 m/s²。假設長10 m、縫寬2 mm、Cd=0.6、Δh=3 m；Q=0.6×0.02√(2×9.81×3)=0.09206 m³/s，均勻縫且無黏性修正。~Use gravitational acceleration g=9.81 m/s². Assume length 10 m, gap 2 mm, Cd=0.6 and head 3 m. Q=0.6×0.02√(2×9.81×3)=0.09206 m³/s, for a uniform slot without viscous correction.||以漏流除水頭平方根作初步正規化，再核對門位、溫度與止水接觸痕；用分區集水找出漏流位置，保留每次比較的潮向。~Normalize leakage initially by square root of head, then compare position, temperature and contact marks. Locate leakage using sectional collection while retaining the tidal direction for each comparison.||小縫中的黏性流可能不遵守孔口平方根關係，不能把正規化曲線偏移全歸於磨耗。雜物卡縫與門體歪斜也會產生相似漏水訊號。~Viscous flow through a very narrow gap may not follow the orifice square-root law. Debris and gate misalignment can imitate wear, so normalized curve changes do not uniquely identify material deterioration.||漏流量增加不能單獨證明止水材料已老化。~Increasing leakage alone does not prove seal-material ageing.
共同原因與備援~Common cause and redundancy||兩套備援設備若共用電源、機房或感測來源，就不是完全獨立。風暴可能同時破壞多條功能鏈，可靠度計算必須把共同原因與單機失效分開。~Redundant equipment sharing power, rooms or sensing is not fully independent. One storm may damage several functional chains, requiring common-cause events to be separated from individual equipment failures.||假設兩單元各獨立失效機率0.02，共同原因機率0.005；簡化總失效q=0.005+0.995×0.02²=0.005398，非本站實測可靠度。~Assume independent unit-failure probabilities 0.02 and common-cause probability 0.005. Simplified total q=0.005+0.995×0.02²=0.005398, not a measured site reliability.||逐項追蹤電源、冷卻、網路、感測和維修狀態的共用節點，用演練事件核對是否真正隔離；將假設獨立的理由寫入失效樹。~Trace shared power, cooling, network, sensing and maintenance dependencies. Use exercise events to verify actual separation and document the justification for each independence assumption in the fault tree.||將共用電纜路徑的兩套系統視為獨立會大幅低估失效。備援設備即使定期空載測試合格，也未必能在淹水、斷電和高荷載同時出現時接替。~Treating two systems in one cable route as independent understates failure. Successful unloaded backup tests do not prove takeover during simultaneous flooding, power loss and high mechanical demand.||設備數量加倍不代表失效機率直接平方。~Doubling equipment does not automatically square the failure probability.
資料延遲與判斷鏈~Data latency in decisions||自動判斷取決於資料的新鮮度、時鐘與品質旗標，畫面顯示合理水位仍可能是舊值。將取樣延遲和運算時間分開，才能定位錯誤。~Automated decisions depend on data age, synchronized clocks and quality flags. A plausible displayed water level may be stale, so sampling latency must be separated from computation time to diagnose the chain.||假設水位線性上升0.12 m/min、資料延遲4 min，未補償的水位差0.48 m；只示範短時線性估算，不外推真實暴潮。~Assume level rises linearly at 0.12 m/min and data latency is 4 min. Uncompensated difference is 0.48 m, a short-term linear illustration rather than a storm-surge forecast.||在離線回放中保留量測時刻與接收時刻，注入舊資料、跳值及缺測，確認品質旗標可追溯；把錯誤定位到傳輸或推估階段。~In offline replay, preserve measurement and receipt times and inject stale, discontinuous or missing records. Verify traceable quality flags and distinguish transmission errors from estimation errors.||重傳機制可能讓資料最後到達卻已失去時效；以接收時刻覆蓋原始時間戳會掩蓋問題。多站同時延遲不能被誤當成一致的高品質證據。~Retransmission may deliver data too late for its purpose. Replacing measurement time with arrival time conceals this defect, and several equally delayed stations do not constitute independent high-quality confirmation.||多個測站數字一致仍可能全是過時資料。~Agreement among stations can still reflect uniformly stale data.
荷載循環與疲勞累積~Load cycles and fatigue accumulation||大型活動結構除風暴荷載外也承受測試與維修循環。疲勞累積依應力範圍分組，小幅循環數量多也可能有影響，但線性損傷和忽略序列只是近似。~Moving structures experience test and maintenance cycles as well as storms. Fatigue accumulation groups stress ranges; many smaller cycles may matter, but linear damage and sequence independence remain approximations.||假設兩組循環n1=2000、N1=100000與n2=300、N2=10000，Miner和D=0.02+0.03=0.05；N值為假設，不作剩餘年限預測。~Assume cycle groups n1=2000, N1=100000 and n2=300, N2=10000. Miner sum D=0.02+0.03=0.05. Assumed capacities do not predict remaining calendar life.||從局部應變時間史辨認循環範圍，核對焊縫細節和腐蝕狀態；將不同運動模式分開計數，並以裂紋檢查挑戰無損傷的計算假設。~Identify stress cycles from local strain histories and check weld detail and corrosion condition. Count movement modes separately and use crack inspection to challenge the calculation assumption of an intact detail.||小於一的損傷和不是無裂紋證明，初始缺陷、應力集中與腐蝕會改變壽命。若只記錄關閘次數而未量應力範圍，也無法建立可靠疲勞譜。~A damage sum below one does not prove absence of cracks; initial defects, stress concentration and corrosion alter life. Closure counts alone cannot establish a fatigue spectrum without stress ranges.||累積損傷小於一並不是永久安全的保證。~A damage sum below one is not a permanent safety guarantee.
''')
 for i,ex,out,un in [(1,'600000/(1025*1200)',.487804878,'m'),(2,'8*60',480,'MN m'),(3,'math.pi**2*200e9*.08/40**2/1e6',98.696044,'MN'),(4,'1025*9.81*20*25/2/1e6',2.5138125,'MN'),(5,'1000*8000/20e6',.4,'m'),(6,'.65*30*.2*math.sqrt(2*9.81)',17.27484298,'m3/s'),(7,'.6*.02*math.sqrt(2*9.81*3)',.0920643,'m3/s'),(8,'.005+.995*.02**2',.005398,'probability'),(9,'.12*4',.48,'m'),(10,'2000/100000+300/10000',.05,'damage')]:a('b222',i,ex,out,un)
